{"4394200": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Trial Zones", "steam_appid": 4394200, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Reddy as he enters the deadly Trial Zones, a twisted gauntlet created by the Xorn Empire. Survive traps, outrun danger, and escape the grip of Commander Xelop. Play the full story solo or with up to four players locally and challenge your friends in the Trap Master vs Survivors mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Mode</strong> — Play through Reddy’s journey across the Trial Zones in a straightforward, action‑focused adventure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local Co‑op (1–4 Players)</strong> — Experience the entire story with friends on the same screen.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trap Master vs Survivors</strong> — One player controls the traps while the others try to survive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Capture The Flag</strong> — 2v2 Traditional CTF mode where you take the enemy flag and return it to base to score.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three Difficulty Options</strong> — Choose the challenge level that fits your playstyle: Easy, Normal, or Survival.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Reddy as he enters the deadly Trial Zones, a twisted gauntlet created by the Xorn Empire. Survive traps, outrun danger, and escape the grip of Commander Xelop. Play the full story solo or with up to four players locally and challenge your friends in the Trap Master vs Survivors mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Mode</strong> — Play through Reddy’s journey across the Trial Zones in a straightforward, action‑focused adventure.</p></li